[[2047,127,66048,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is controlled by the\nignition (INT) from the line for fuse  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B 98 B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : when the brake pedal is pressed, the switch closes\nand sends the operating signal to the check device inside the rev\ncounter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 5 of connector A).</p><p>The supply for the check device inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15\narrives directly from the battery (maxifuse B99) at pins 10 and\n16 of connector A, through fuses F2 and F3 of the junction unit\nB1;</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               The former protects the left hand lighting circuits, the\nlatter protects the right hand circuits.</p><p>The check device thereby controls the supply\n(pin 18 and pin 13 of connector A) for the side brake lights in\nthe rear light clusters \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>In the case of failures in the circuit,\nthe &#x27;lights failure&#x27; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15 - comes on, with\nthe supply controlled by the ignition (IINT), pin 15 of connector\nA, of the line protected by fuse F4 of the additional fuse box B98B.</strong></p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the signal for\noperating the centre rear light cluster \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               via the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 18, connector D and pin 14 of connector E).</p><p>The braking signal for the switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30\nis sent from the switch to the ABS \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 See\n\t\tE7020\n\t\tABS\n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 and - on some\nversions - to the engine management control unit as well \n\n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 See\n\t\tE5030\n\t\tPETROL ENGINE ELECTRONIC MANAGEMENT\n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 \n                                 .</strong></p>"]]